# Copy this file to embedding_api_key.txt and paste your real Alibaba
# Bailian (DashScope) API key.
#   cp secrets/embedding_api_key.txt.example secrets/embedding_api_key.txt
#   printf '%s' 'sk-your-real-dashscope-key' > secrets/embedding_api_key.txt
#
# Get a key at: https://bailian.console.aliyun.com/
#
# Used by the EMBEDDING provider — every /embeddings call:
#   - long-term memory (mem0 + pgvector)
#   - knowledge-base RAG
#   - code index
#   - semantic cache
# and also by the DashScope-native media generation API (wan2.x) when
# ENABLE_MEDIA_GENERATION=true.
#
# DeepSeek has no /embeddings endpoint, which is why chat and embeddings
# are split into two providers. See .env.production for the full rationale.
#
# The file is gitignored — it will never be committed.
# docker-compose.yml mounts it read-only at /run/secrets/embedding_api_key
# inside the app container. config.py reads it via EMBEDDING_API_KEY_FILE.
sk-your-dashscope-api-key-here
